# What a `vercel deploy` from a local checkout must never upload.
#
# The Vercel CLI does NOT read .gitignore, and its built-in ignore list does not cover a plain
# .env - so without this file the bank-internal codebooks (git-ignored in data/codebooks/) and
# any local secrets would be uploaded and bundled into the function. The codebooks reach the
# function from the private Blob store instead (roadmap D3). Verified 22 Sept 2026.

# secrets and local configuration
.env
.env.*
.vercel/

# the codebooks and anything else bank-internal or local
data/
*.xlsx
*.xlsm
*.sqlite3

# not needed at runtime
tests/
ui/prototype/
.venv/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
__pycache__/
Dockerfile
